OL,3,GNEWSARiders fear for future of biking
OL,4,A'community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of trial bike riders in
OL,7,FRotherham have said they fear their
OL,8,F"special community" will be lost if
OL,9,Fthey cannot secure planning permission.
OL,11,FA proposal to change farmland at Hooton
OL,12,FRoberts for use as a recreational trial
OL,13,Fbikes area was originally declined in
OL,14,F2024 over concerns for the impact on
OL,15,Flocal woodland and potential noise
OL,16,Fpollution.
OL,18,FThe owners, who also run Hooton Lodge
OL,19,FFarm Campsite, say they will have to
OL,20,Fclose permanently if the application is
OL,21,Frefused again.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
