OL,3,GNEWSARiders fear for future of biking
OL,4,A'community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Bramidge of Rotherham Council
OL,7,Fsaid: "We recognise the interest in
OL,8,Fthis matter from all parties and will
OL,9,Fcontinue to follow the appropriate
OL,10,Fprocedures as the assessment of the
OL,11,Fapplication progresses."
